{"ts": 1791258032.690309, "type": "step", "step": 14, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Evaluation\nWe evaluate reliability with **pass^k** rather than pass@k. pass^k means the build succeeds on all k trials, which matches the goal of a dependable Friday build. pass@k would only require one success out of k and is better for measuring best-case success, not reliability.\n\nIf needed, we can also mention that any proxy metric should be justified by why it tracks the real goal."}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 4, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.2930966219605771, "pomdp": 0.2930966219605771, "pass_k": 0.3789796850426231}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.6914904699846633, "motivation": 0.7582565640937223, "reliance": 0.46411302654010417, "persistence": 0.3650501251360847, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.25123269521051517, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.32885785171436704, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
